<title>AUSTRIA: Austria c.bank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria c.bank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Thursday it was calling for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed and unchanged rate of three percent.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0800 GMT on Friday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Last week the bank allotted 16.98 billion schillings in repos, filling 14 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
